; ==========================================
; CHALLENGE 2: Rocket Launch Countdown
; Language: Dhivehi / ދިވެހި (dv)
; ==========================================
; Count down from 5 to 1, then launch!

ބަދަލުކުރޭ counter 5

launch_loop:
ސިސްޓަމް_ކޯލް counter
ކަނޑާ counter 1
އަޅާކިޔާ counter 0
if_different launch_loop

; Blastoff!
ބަދަލުކުރޭ box 999
ސިސްޓަމް_ކޯލް box
